description:
Surf the web without tracking with a VPN, shield your devices with Antivirus, & guard your identity with an all-in-one app.


What's new:

* Manage your subscription and online security solutions more easily with a new products screen, which keeps everything you've purchased neatly in one place;
* You can now extend the pause VPN feature for 5mins, 30mins, or 2hrs;
* As always, we added a few visual and minor fixes to improve your experience with the Surfshark app.
